        "encoded": "%3Cp%3EObserving%20inference%20in%20production%20requires%20more%20than%20tracking%20latency%20and%20error%20rates.%20When%20optimizing%20local%20LLM%20development%E2%80%94such%20as%20running%207B%20to%2014B%20parameter%20models%20like%20Gemma%20or%20Qwen%20on%20hardware%20constrained%20to%2016GB%20of%20RAM%E2%80%94it%20demands%20a%20deep%20understanding%20of%20token%20generation%20bottlenecks,%20memory%20swapping,%20and%20queue%20depths%20at%20the%20model%20serving%20layer.%3C/p%3E",
